## Why This Is Asked

Evaluates on-device NLP design under strict privacy and latency constraints, with multilingual support and a practical two-stage architecture that a junior engineer can implement and iterate.

## Key Concepts

- On-device inference and privacy-preserving design
- Lightweight multilingual models (FastText or small embeddings)
- Rule-based prefiltering for latency
- Drift detection and rollback strategy

